      "stem": "Suppose $f'(x) = (x^2+2)^2$ and that $f(1) = \\frac{8}{15}$. Find $f(x)$.",
      "final_answer": "$f(x) = \\frac{1}{5}x^5 + \\frac{4}{3}x^3 + 4x - 5$",
