          "Integrate term-by-term to find $f(x) = \\frac{1}{5}x^5 + \\frac{4}{3}x^3 + 4x + c$.",
          "Substitute $x = 1$ and equate to $\\frac{8}{15}$.",
          "Solve for $c$: $\\frac{83}{15} + c = \\frac{8}{15} \\implies c = -5$.",
